marily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "71746225", "author": {"steamid": "76561197963688429", "personaname": "Vincent", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197963688429/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 871, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 362, "last_played": 1766942623, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I dont recommend this game - unless the full version will be greatly improved. \n\nI don't understand why it has so many favourable reviews. It is basicaly Serious Sam with just couple of very small, random levels - meaning it is getting boring quickly (many people say its roguelike mixed with Borderlands but thats absurd. Just beacause it has cartoonish graphics and numbers fly when you wound monsters doesnt make it similar to Borderlands...).\n\nBad:\n- Very grindy - slow character progression & tough bosses\n- Level generation is very simple. After couple of runs everything looks the same, including special mini-levels (vaults).\n- Very random - sometimes you get great upgrades and best skills in single episode, sometimes nothing\n- For a roguelike, it has very limited variety of weapons and their stats. (Again - it is NOT like in Borderlands, where one type of weapons can have much different combinations of stats/abilities). Forging possibilities are also minimal.\n\nGood:\n- Basic weapons look nice\n- Opponents and bosses are interesting\n- Had fun for first few hours\n\nOf course there is a chance that the producer will improve and expand this game before the full release - but since it already has positive reviews I dont think he will bother....", "timestamp_created": 1593537501, "timestamp_updated": 1593537501, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.459890872240066528", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1593567684, "developer_response": "Sorry for your bad experience, we will add more content and randomness in the future update, stay tuned.", "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}